mode: "100644"
header: "---\nname: social-selling-and-dm\ndescription: >-\n  Social selling and DM funnels — consent-first selling in the DMs, never spam. Use when someone wants to \"sell in the DMs,\" \"set up a\n  comment-to-DM funnel,\" \"do DM outreach,\" \"turn comments/followers into leads or customers,\" or convert\n  intent into private conversations. Works ONLY as a response to intent (comments, story replies, follows,\n  keyword DMs) via the comment->DM->email funnel — never cold outreach. Uses the WARMS framework. Reads\n  brand-profile + voice-builder + goals-and-kpis first. WoopSocial has NO DM/comment surface: the agent\n  designs the funnel and drafts the trigger post, DM sequences, and manual outreach scripts; WoopSocial\n  publishes the trigger posts; the actual comment->DM automation runs in an external official-Meta-API\n  tool (ManyChat/LinkDM/etc.) or a human sends warm DMs; consent-first always, ban-behaviors avoided,\n  metrics never fabricated. Distinct from link-in-bio-and-traffic, reply-and-comment-writer, and email-and-newsletter.\nversion: 1.0.0\nprompt-source: prompt.toon\n---\n"
